> >
> > Yep, but never directly after the customer had the problem, and the showLogs() only shows the result from the last login (or can I access older logs somehow?), which was always successful when I tried it. I will try and generate the problem again and look at the log. It is difficult to replicate the problem though - I have no idea why it occurs, might take a while...
> >
> >
